  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Actuarial Capacity Building for MOF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the grant is to build the technical and actuarial capacity of the recently established Research and Actuarial Division under the Department of Social Protection of the Ministry of Finance.  The technical assistance will strengthen actuarial competence, enhance the ability to perform actuarial projection and analysis, develop modeling software, assemble and analyze valuation data, and learn from international actuarial best practices.  The grant will also support an assessment of the existing institutional arrangements, and to prepare a work plan including strategic approaches on the development of human resource capacity. TTL changed from Yee Mun Sin to Xiaoqing Yu 2/09/2007</narrative>
  </description>
